WEBVTT

00:07.800 --> 00:09.100
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.100 --> 00:10.900
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.900 --> 00:12.367
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.367 --> 00:14.533
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.533 --> 00:17.367
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.367 --> 00:19.467
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.467 --> 00:21.467
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.467 --> 00:23.367
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.367 --> 00:25.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.000 --> 00:27.500
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.500 --> 00:29.333
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.333 --> 00:31.433
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.433 --> 00:33.467
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.467 --> 00:35.333
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.333 --> 00:37.667
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.667 --> 00:39.600
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.600 --> 00:40.933
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.933 --> 00:42.800
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.800 --> 00:45.533
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.533 --> 00:47.833
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.833 --> 00:49.333
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:02.867 --> 01:04.600
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:04.600 --> 01:09.167
Sorry about this barnacles,
but it's spring cleaning time.
对不起这个藤壶，
但现在是春季大扫除时间。

01:09.167 --> 01:10.700
- I forgive you.
- 我原谅你了。

01:10.700 --> 01:13.167
[whirring]
[呼呼]

01:13.167 --> 01:16.300
I take it back!
[screaming]
我收回来！
[尖叫]

01:21.667 --> 01:25.233
- There, my masterpiece.
[yelling]
- 在那里，我的杰作。
[大喊]

01:25.233 --> 01:28.067
What the--ahh!
什么啊——啊！

01:28.067 --> 01:32.300
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

01:32.300 --> 01:34.767
- Ah, perfect.
- 啊，完美。

01:34.767 --> 01:39.300
No!
[grunting]
不！
[咕噜声]

01:39.300 --> 01:43.633
What is that menace
up to now?
那是什么威胁
到现在为止？

01:43.633 --> 01:46.567
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:48.067 --> 01:51.200
How many--
[grunting]
有多少——
[咕噜声]

01:51.200 --> 01:53.800
- Whoa! Whoa!
- 哇！哇！

01:53.800 --> 01:58.433
- Will you please
turn that thing--
- 请你
转动那个东西——

01:58.433 --> 01:59.833
- Oh, hey, Squidward.
- 哦，嘿，章鱼哥。

01:59.833 --> 02:02.800
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:02.800 --> 02:03.933
- What are you saying?
- 你在说什么？

02:03.933 --> 02:08.567
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:08.567 --> 02:10.333
kids: Yay!
孩子们：耶！

02:10.333 --> 02:13.333
- I can't hear you
over the hose noise.
- 我听不到你说话
超过软管噪音。

02:13.333 --> 02:16.600
Hold on, I'll turn it off.
等一下，我把它关掉。

02:16.600 --> 02:21.067
kids: Aww.
孩子们：哇。

02:21.067 --> 02:23.933
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:23.933 --> 02:25.733
- What's you want
to tell me, Squidward?
- 你想要什么
告诉我，章鱼哥？

02:25.733 --> 02:27.500
- Turn off the hose.
- 关闭软管。

02:27.500 --> 02:29.767
- I already did. Here, I'll turn
it back on just for you.
- 我已经这么做了。在这里，我要转身
它只为你而重新开启。

02:29.767 --> 02:32.633
- No, no, no. wait--
[grunting]
- 不，不，不。等等——
[咕噜声]

02:32.633 --> 02:34.467
- Yep, it was off.
How'd I do?
- 是的，它已经关闭了。
我怎么样？

02:34.467 --> 02:39.333
- Horrible!
Everything you do is horrible!
- 太可怕了！
你所做的一切都太可怕了！

02:39.333 --> 02:42.167
I wish you would
just move away already.
我希望你会
快走开吧。

02:42.167 --> 02:46.067
- Move away?
But Squidward, I like it--
- 搬走？
但是章鱼哥，我喜欢——

02:46.067 --> 02:47.133
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

02:47.133 --> 02:49.067
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:49.067 --> 02:52.567
- Did you see that? Huh, I
wonder what's making me sneeze.
- 你看到了吗？ Huh, I
想知道是什么让我打喷嚏。

02:52.567 --> 02:54.400
- Ahh!
- 啊！

02:54.400 --> 02:57.333
Probably all the barnacle dust
you kicked up.
可能全都是藤壶灰尘
你踢了起来。

02:57.333 --> 02:58.800
- Oh, Squidward,
that makes no sense.
-哦，章鱼哥，
这毫无意义。

02:58.800 --> 03:00.800
Who ever heard of dust
making you sneeze?
谁听说过灰尘
让你打喷嚏？

03:00.800 --> 03:04.067
- Oh, fine, maybe you're
allergic to your pineapple.
- 哦，好吧，也许你是
对你的菠萝过敏。

03:04.067 --> 03:08.233
- [laughing] You can't be
allergic to a house.
- [笑]你不可能
对房子过敏。

03:08.233 --> 03:10.100
[sniffs]
[chuckles]
[嗅嗅]
[笑声]

03:10.100 --> 03:14.833
Or could you--
no. [laughing]
或者你可以——
不。 [笑]

03:14.833 --> 03:16.233
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:16.233 --> 03:19.167
Oh, why do I even bother
trying to explain things to him?
哦，我为什么还要打扰
试图向他解释事情？

03:19.167 --> 03:21.967
Of course you can be
allergic to a house.
当然你可以
对房子过敏。

03:21.967 --> 03:24.767
I ju--wait.
我就——等等。

03:24.767 --> 03:28.067
You can be allergic
to a house.
你可能过敏
到一所房子。

03:28.067 --> 03:29.967
[chuckles]
[笑声]

03:34.433 --> 03:37.567
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:41.400 --> 03:44.533
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:52.667 --> 03:56.067
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:56.067 --> 03:59.100
Ah, ah, ah.
[stifled sneeze]
啊啊啊啊。
[打喷嚏]

03:59.100 --> 04:01.067
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

04:01.067 --> 04:04.667
- Ah.
[sneezes]
- 啊。
[打喷嚏]

04:04.667 --> 04:08.300
- [growls and hisses]
- Gary, no, no, no, no!
- [咆哮和嘶嘶声]
- 加里，不，不，不，不！

04:08.300 --> 04:10.700
- [howling]
[both grunting]
- [嚎叫]
[两人都咕哝着]

04:10.700 --> 04:13.867
- Aww, playtime, that's nice.
- 哇哦，玩耍时间，真好。

04:13.867 --> 04:15.800
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

04:19.533 --> 04:21.800
[horn blaring]
[喇叭声]

04:21.800 --> 04:22.767
- [sneezes]
- [打喷嚏]

04:22.767 --> 04:25.067
- [meows]
- Good mor--
- [喵]
- 早上好--

04:25.067 --> 04:26.500
good mor--[sneezes]
早上好——[打喷嚏]

04:26.500 --> 04:29.133
good--[sneezes]
好——[打喷嚏]

04:29.133 --> 04:32.267
Good morning, Gary.
早上好，加里。

04:34.133 --> 04:36.267
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

04:37.800 --> 04:39.367
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

04:39.367 --> 04:41.500
Ahh!
啊！

04:44.800 --> 04:46.733
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

04:50.467 --> 04:52.900
Ah--ah--ah--
[sneezes]
啊——啊——啊——
[打喷嚏]

04:52.900 --> 04:55.067
Ahh!
啊！

04:55.067 --> 04:59.200
- You okay in there, SpongeBob?
[chuckles]
- 你在里面还好吗，海绵宝宝？
[笑声]

04:59.200 --> 05:00.833
- Oh, morning--[sneezes]
- 哦，早上好--[打喷嚏]

05:00.833 --> 05:02.800
Morning, Squidwa--
[sneezes]
早上好，鱿鱼——
[打喷嚏]

05:02.800 --> 05:06.133
- Oh my, having a little
sneezing fit are we?
- 天哪，有一点
我们打喷嚏适合吗？

05:06.133 --> 05:11.200
- Yeah, I think you were right.
I must be allergic to my house.
- 是的，我认为你是对的。
我一定是对我家过敏。

05:11.200 --> 05:14.967
- Oh, that's too bad.
I guess you'll have to move.
- 哦，那太糟糕了。
我想你得搬家了。

05:14.967 --> 05:18.067
- Move?
- Yes. You can't stay here
- 移动？
- 是的。你不能留在这里

05:18.067 --> 05:20.367
or your allergy
will just get worse.
或者你的过敏症
只会变得更糟。

05:20.367 --> 05:22.467
Hey, look at that.
- Look at what?
嘿，看看那个。
- 看什么？

05:22.467 --> 05:24.500
[sneezes]
- See?
[打喷嚏]
- 看到了吗？

05:24.500 --> 05:27.433
Your allergy is already
getting worse.
你已经过敏了
变得更糟。

05:27.433 --> 05:30.633
- But--but where will I go?
- Don't worry, SpongeBob.
-但是-但是我要去哪里？
- 别担心，海绵宝宝。

05:30.633 --> 05:34.133
I'll help you find
a great new home...
我会帮你找到
一个很棒的新家...

05:34.133 --> 05:35.533
far away from here.
离这里很远。

05:35.533 --> 05:38.067
- But, Squidward,
I love this old pineapple.
-但是，章鱼哥，
我喜欢这个老菠萝。

05:38.067 --> 05:40.700
We've had a lot of good times
together.
我们度过了很多美好时光
在一起。

05:40.700 --> 05:42.500
Whee!
哎哟！

05:42.500 --> 05:44.633
- [laughing]
- [笑]

05:50.067 --> 05:54.967
[laughter]
[笑声]

05:55.633 --> 05:58.633
- [sneezing]
- [打喷嚏]

05:58.633 --> 06:01.067
Oh, Squidward,
my sneezing is getting worse.
哦，章鱼哥，
我的喷嚏越来越严重。

06:01.067 --> 06:03.800
I'll miss my pineapple,
but I guess you're right.
我会想念我的菠萝
但我想你是对的。

06:03.800 --> 06:06.300
I ha--[sneezes]
I have to move.
我哈——[打喷嚏]
我得走了。

06:06.300 --> 06:07.633
- Now you're talking.
- 现在你在说话了。

06:07.633 --> 06:09.800
Trust me, you'll feel
so much better
相信我，你会感觉到
好多了

06:09.800 --> 06:12.067
when you're clear of me--
your pineapple.
当你远离我时——
你的菠萝。

06:12.067 --> 06:14.300
- Squidward,
you're a good friend.
- 章鱼哥，
你是个好朋友。

06:14.300 --> 06:16.433
- I know.
- 我知道。

06:22.167 --> 06:25.533
- This would make a great new
house, what do you think?
- 这将是一个伟大的新
房子，你觉得怎么样？

06:25.533 --> 06:27.067
- Eh.
- 呃。

06:27.067 --> 06:29.533
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

06:29.533 --> 06:31.867
* Who lives in a banana
under the sea? *
*谁住在香蕉里
在海底？ *

06:31.867 --> 06:33.767
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

06:33.767 --> 06:36.600
- Whoa!
I don't know.
- 哇！
我不知道。

06:36.600 --> 06:39.367
- How about this spicy number?
- 这个辣数字怎么样？

06:39.367 --> 06:41.967
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

06:41.967 --> 06:44.067
* Who lives in a hot pepper
under the sea? *
*谁住在辣椒里
在海底？ *

06:44.067 --> 06:47.200
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- [grunting]
所有：海绵宝宝！
- [咕哝]

06:47.200 --> 06:50.433
- Hot listing, but no.
- 热门上市，但没有。

06:50.433 --> 06:53.067
- Well, there's a yummy one.
- Mmm.
- 嗯，有一个很好吃的。
- 嗯。

06:53.067 --> 06:55.367
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

06:55.367 --> 06:58.300
Who lives in a chicken parmesan
hero under the sea?
谁住在帕尔玛鸡肉里
海底英雄？

06:58.300 --> 07:00.200
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

07:00.200 --> 07:04.400
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

07:04.400 --> 07:06.700
Nope.
没有。

07:06.700 --> 07:08.233
- How 'bout this one?
- 这个怎么样？

07:08.233 --> 07:11.567
- Not bad,
but let's think outside the box.
- 还不错，
但让我们跳出框框思考。

07:15.133 --> 07:17.300
- Okay, so that's a no.
- 好吧，所以这是不。

07:17.300 --> 07:20.800
I think I know
what you're looking for.
我想我知道
你在寻找什么。

07:20.800 --> 07:23.633
How about this for space?
这个对于太空来说怎么样？

07:23.633 --> 07:26.500
- Hey, what's this lever do?
- [grunts]
- 嘿，这个杠杆是做什么用的？
- [咕哝]

07:26.500 --> 07:30.067
- Automatic balconies!
- [grunts]
- 自动阳台！
- [咕哝]

07:30.067 --> 07:32.133
- Squidward, watch this.
- Wait, wait, no, no, no!
- 章鱼哥，看这个。
- 等等，等等，不，不，不！

07:32.133 --> 07:34.067
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:34.067 --> 07:37.767
- Hey, Squidward, this is great.
What does this button do?
- 嘿，章鱼哥，这太棒了。
这个按钮有什么作用？

07:37.767 --> 07:40.067
- [yelling]
- [laughing]
- [大喊]
- [笑]

07:40.067 --> 07:42.933
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:46.667 --> 07:48.967
- That's what it does.
- 这就是它的作用。

07:48.967 --> 07:51.167
Aww, why couldn't I live
in that last place?
哇哦，为什么我不能活下去
在最后那个地方？

07:51.167 --> 07:54.767
- Oh, that house was too
dangerous for you. Ow.
- 哦，那栋房子也是
对你来说很危险。噢。

07:54.767 --> 07:57.300
Besides, it was just a house.
更何况，那只是一座房子。

07:57.300 --> 08:01.600
But this is a castle
with a moat and everything.
但这是一座城堡
有护城河和一切。

08:01.600 --> 08:04.400
It's a long way
from Bikini Bottom.
路还很长
来自比基尼底部。

08:04.400 --> 08:05.667
- I know.
- Huh?
- 我知道。
- 啊？

08:05.667 --> 08:07.267
- I mean,
don't worry about it.
- 我的意思是，
不用担心。

08:07.267 --> 08:09.200
It's a short 11-hour commute
to the Krusty Krab from here.
通勤仅需 11 小时
从这里到蟹堡王。

08:09.200 --> 08:10.833
- Well, I don't know,
Squidward.
- 嗯，我不知道，
章鱼哥。

08:10.833 --> 08:13.667
It doesn't seem like
the safest neighborhood.
看起来不像
最安全的社区。

08:16.067 --> 08:19.533
- All right, SpongeBob, this is
the last house on my list,
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，这是
我名单上的最后一所房子

08:19.533 --> 08:23.400
but I think it's got everything
you're looking for.
但我认为它拥有一切
你正在寻找。

08:23.400 --> 08:25.067
What do you think?
你怎么认为？

08:25.067 --> 08:28.533
- I don't know.
It doesn't look like much.
- 我不知道。
看起来并不多。

08:28.533 --> 08:33.100
both: Wow.
两人：哇。

08:33.100 --> 08:34.367
- Pretty!
- 漂亮的！

08:34.367 --> 08:35.833
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:35.833 --> 08:37.867
This place is amazing.
这个地方太棒了。

08:37.867 --> 08:40.133
It's like living
in the future.
这就像生活
在未来。

08:40.133 --> 08:43.233
- Ooh, check out
these cool stairs.
- 哦，看看
这些很酷的楼梯。

08:43.233 --> 08:45.433
Whee!
哎哟！

08:45.433 --> 08:47.567
- Uh, SpongeBob?
- Whee!
- 呃，海绵宝宝？
- 呼！

08:47.567 --> 08:50.467
- [grunting]
- Squidward? Squidward?
- [咕哝]
- 章鱼哥？章鱼哥？

08:50.467 --> 08:51.567
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

08:51.567 --> 08:53.667
- This place is awesome.
- 这个地方太棒了。

08:53.667 --> 08:56.233
[back cracking]
- Yeah, it is, isn't it?
[背部开裂]
- 是的，是的，不是吗？

08:56.233 --> 08:58.133
I can't believe
I get to live here.
我不敢相信
我可以住在这里。

08:58.133 --> 09:00.167
It's so much cooler
than your house.
凉快多了
比你的房子。

09:00.167 --> 09:03.167
- [grunting]
You're right.
- [咕哝]
你是对的。

09:03.167 --> 09:05.300
This place is way too cool
for you.
这个地方太酷了
为了你。

09:05.300 --> 09:07.833
- Wait, what?
- I mean, living in a place
- 等等，什么？
- 我的意思是，住在一个地方

09:07.833 --> 09:11.067
like this can put
a lot of pressure on a guy.
像这样可以放
对一个人来说压力很大。

09:11.067 --> 09:13.967
The constant attention
you get,
持续的关注
你得到，

09:13.967 --> 09:17.600
and all the fabulous parties
you'd host.
以及所有精彩的派对
你会主持。

09:17.600 --> 09:21.633
[playing flute]
[长笛演奏]

09:21.633 --> 09:23.233
Eh?
- Oh, it's quite good.
呃？
- 哦，这很好。

09:23.233 --> 09:25.100
- Certainly worthy
of this house.
- 当然值得
这所房子的。

09:25.100 --> 09:26.667
- [whimpering]
- Indeed.
- [呜咽]
- 确实如此。

09:26.667 --> 09:28.767
- Not to mention
all the covers
- 更不用说
所有封面

09:28.767 --> 09:31.433
of "Cool Calamari"
you'd have to pose for.
《酷鱿鱼》
你必须摆出姿势。

09:31.433 --> 09:34.800
No, I can't let you
go through that, SpongeBob.
不，我不能让你
海绵宝宝，经历一下吧。

09:34.800 --> 09:38.333
So I tell you what,
I'll live here for you.
所以我告诉你什么，
我会为你住在这里。

09:38.333 --> 09:41.167
- Yeah, but where will I live?
- You can have my old house.
- 是的，但是我住在哪里？
- 你可以拥有我的老房子。

09:41.167 --> 09:43.867
- Really?
That is so nice of you.
- 真的吗？
你真是太好了。

09:43.867 --> 09:45.900
That way I'll be one house
closer to Patrick.
这样我就成为一所房子
离帕特里克更近了。

09:45.900 --> 09:47.567
- Great, it's a done deal.
- 太好了，事情就这么定了。

09:47.567 --> 09:50.633
So if you don't mind, I have
a lot of settling in to do.
所以如果你不介意的话，我有
有很多事情要做。

09:50.633 --> 09:52.233
Bye-bye.
- Okay, so I guess
再见。
- 好吧，所以我猜

09:52.233 --> 09:56.067
I'll see you la--
我会见到你拉--

09:56.067 --> 10:01.200
- [sighs] Now this is how
I was always meant to live.
- [叹气]现在就是这样
我本来就注定要活下去。

10:01.200 --> 10:03.233
[chuckles and yawns]
[轻笑和哈欠]

10:03.233 --> 10:05.167
Bedtime.
就寝时间。

10:09.700 --> 10:14.333
Oh, a built in alarm clock.
Hoo, this place has got it all.
哦，内置闹钟。
呼，这个地方已经拥有了一切。

10:14.333 --> 10:17.267
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

10:20.533 --> 10:23.067
[snoring]
[打鼾]

10:23.067 --> 10:24.600
[horns blaring]
- Ten, nine, eight...
[喇叭声]
- 十、九、八……

10:24.600 --> 10:26.900
Wha--what's happening?
- Seven, six, five...
什——发生什么事了？
- 七、六、五……

10:26.900 --> 10:29.567
- Oh, no.
It's not an alarm clock.
- 哦，不。
这不是闹钟。

10:29.567 --> 10:33.900
It's a countdown!
- Four, three, two, one.
这是倒计时！
- 四，三，二，一。

10:36.833 --> 10:39.967
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:48.033 --> 10:51.333
Huh? What--what the--
uh.
啊？什么——什么——
呃。

10:51.333 --> 10:54.267
That was horrible.
那太可怕了。

10:56.433 --> 10:58.033
But this is even worse!
但这更糟糕！

10:58.033 --> 11:01.967
Ahh!
啊！

11:01.967 --> 11:06.067
- Doink.
Now this really feels like home.
- 多因克。
现在这里真的感觉像家一样。

11:06.067 --> 11:09.267
Ahh!
啊！

11:09.267 --> 11:12.233
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

11:12.233 --> 11:14.667
- Squidward, you dropped in
for a visit.
- 章鱼哥，你进来了
参观。

11:14.667 --> 11:16.067
- I am not visiting.
- 我不来拜访。

11:16.067 --> 11:19.500
This is my house
and I want it back.
这是我的房子
我想要它回来。

11:19.500 --> 11:22.700
- Sorry, Squidward, but you gave
it to me fair and square...
- 对不起，章鱼哥，但你给了
对我来说公平公正...

11:22.700 --> 11:24.200
pants.
裤子。

11:24.200 --> 11:27.100
Besides, if I move out now,
I have no where to go.
另外，如果我现在搬出去，
我无处可去。

11:27.100 --> 11:30.700
- Okay, fine, I'll just take
your old pineapple.
- 好吧，好吧，我就接受
你的老菠萝

11:30.700 --> 11:32.567
Huh?
啊？

11:32.567 --> 11:36.100
- Sorry, Squidward,
but this is my house now.
- 对不起，章鱼哥，
但这现在是我的房子了。

11:36.100 --> 11:39.067
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

11:39.067 --> 11:43.300
- Well, then, where am I
supposed to live?
- 那么，我在哪里
应该活着吗？

11:43.300 --> 11:47.367
- Night, Squidward.
- [grumbles]
- 晚安，章鱼哥。
- [抱怨]

11:47.367 --> 11:49.900
[sneezes]
Ow.
[打喷嚏]
噢。

[打喷嚏]
噢。